Each scan sequence:
1. reset rising edge priority: clear count and accumulated volume, close valve and clear pending, ignore start, flow and confirm for this scan.
2. idle or waiting confirm, start rising edge starts new bottle, clear bottle accumulated and open valve. If previous pending confirm, cancel previous pending first, then process new bottle. During filling, new start edge does not reset bottle.
3. while filling add current flowVol; startup scan counts too. Accumulated volume reaches or exceeds current targetVol immediately close valve and set bottle pending confirm.
4. Immediately after closing valve this scan read doneSensor; if already TRUE, this scan confirm and count. If FALSE, confirm in later first TRUE scan (unless reset or new bottle first). Each confirmation max one bottle, clear immediately. sensor sustained true no repeat. If new bottle starts and reaches target in same scan, confirm new bottle.
5. Each confirm increments fillsToday +1; if old 32767, still complete and clear, count stays 32767. Reset starts zero.

